  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Legal Counsel for C-cases where Commitment has been terminated</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract regarding legal advice and/or legal assistance in court cases or similar where the Danida project has terminated its commitment, to effectively follow-up on cases of corruption and irregularities (c-cases).

Two specific projects need legal services but the contract is not limited to these two projects.
The first relates to a business to business project supported by Danida where a local partner used Danida support for hiring consultants for other purposes and Danida took the case to court. The name of the project is called Clickhouse. 
The other relates a mismanagement of funds by an Agriculture Extension Officer under the project Agriculture Extension Project. The case has been taken to court.</narrative>
  </description>
